    <briefdescription>
<para>Public API of the ISO 15765-2 (ISO-TP) library. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This module groups the public interface and its supporting submodules: <ref refid="group__isotp__config" kindref="compound">Configuration</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__defs" kindref="compound">Definitions</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__protocol" kindref="compound">Codec</ref> and <ref refid="group__isotp__link" kindref="compound">Link</ref>.</para>
<para>Include this single header to use the library: <itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="isotp__config_8h" kindref="compound">isotp_config.h</ref> build-time configuration (buffer sizes, protocol defaults) </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="isotp__defs_8h" kindref="compound">isotp_defs.h</ref> frame types, flow status, N_Result codes, big-endian helpers </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="isotp__protocol_8h" kindref="compound">isotp_protocol.h</ref> frame codec: decode, encode SF/FF/CF/FC, STmin </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="isotp__link_8h" kindref="compound">isotp_link.h</ref> transport layer of one connection (segmentation, flow control, timing) </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
